    "A cup of coffee": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une tasse de café"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A good coffee to keep this project going": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un bon café pour faire avancer ce projet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A session waiting for your answer does not count as running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une session qui attend votre réponse ne compte pas comme active."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sudoers rule for /usr/bin/pmset disablesleep": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une règle sudoers pour /usr/bin/pmset disablesleep"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activation after": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activation après"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds one line to ~/.zshrc so commands running longer than a few seconds arm KoffeeLid too. Open a new terminal afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajoute une ligne à ~/.zshrc pour que les commandes de plus de quelques secondes activent aussi KoffeeLid. Ouvrez ensuite un nouveau terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After allowing Screen Recording, quit and reopen KoffeeLid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après avoir autorisé l’enregistrement de l’écran, quittez puis rouvrez KoffeeLid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All set": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout est prêt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Input Monitoring": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autoriser la surveillance de l’entrée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Notifications": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autoriser les notifications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Screen Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autoriser l’enregistrement de l’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Screen Recording for KoffeeLid, then quit and reopen it. Without it, the effect cannot show your desktop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisez l’enregistrement de l’écran pour KoffeeLid, puis quittez et rouvrez-le. Sans cela, l’effet ne peut pas montrer votre bureau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autoriser…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another app or automation put your Mac to sleep while KoffeeLid was armed. Check your charging, scheduling, and automation settings before trying again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une autre app ou automatisation a mis votre Mac en veille alors que KoffeeLid était activé. Vérifiez vos réglages de charge, de programmation et d’automatisation avant de réessayer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm ${applicationName}": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer ${applicationName}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm KoffeeLid": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer KoffeeLid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm KoffeeLid + screen on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer KoffeeLid + écran allumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm KoffeeLid and keep the display awake indefinitely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active KoffeeLid et garde l’écran allumé indéfiniment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm after closing by": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer après une fermeture de"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm while Claude Code or a terminal command is running": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer tant que Claude Code ou une commande du terminal tourne"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm while you work": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S’activer pendant que vous travaillez"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Armed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Armed + screen on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé + écran allumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Armed for one close": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé pour une fermeture"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Armed keeps your Mac running with the lid closed, until you turn KoffeeLid off. Armed + screen on also keeps the display awake while the lid is open. Right-click twice within %d seconds to get it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé garde votre Mac en marche écran rabattu, jusqu’à ce que vous désactiviez KoffeeLid. Activé + écran allumé garde aussi l’écran allumé tant qu’il est ouvert. Pour l’obtenir, faites deux clics droits en moins de %d secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arming": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At 0%, the effect waits for each sensor report and runs about 150 ms behind the lid. At 100%, it runs ahead, about 80 ms behind.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À 0 %, l’effet attend chaque mesure du capteur, environ 150 ms derrière l’écran. À 100 %, il anticipe, environ 80 ms derrière."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At 100%, the zoom is the true geometry. Responsiveness is how far the effect runs ahead of the lid sensor: low is smoothest and a little late, high sticks to the lid with a little jitter on slow closes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À 100 %, le zoom suit la géométrie réelle. La réactivité règle l’avance de l’effet sur le capteur de l’écran : basse, il est plus fluide et un peu en retard ; haute, il colle à l’écran, avec un léger tremblement sur les fermetures lentes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-Arm": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activation auto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-armed while a command runs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé automatiquement tant qu'une commande tourne"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-armed while Claude Code and a command run": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé automatiquement tant que Claude Code et une commande tournent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-armed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé automatiquement"
