          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code & agents": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code et agents"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code hooks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suivi de Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code: %d, commands: %d": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code : %d, commandes : %d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click Update to download and install it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cliquez sur Mettre à jour pour la télécharger et l’installer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fermer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Console shows what happened, under “Crash Reports”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Console montre ce qui s’est passé, sous « Rapports de blocage »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Crash recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reprise après plantage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Crashes in the last %d days": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plantages ces %d derniers jours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Health": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Santé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In System Settings › Notifications › KoffeeLid, turn on “Allow notifications”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Réglages Système › Notifications › KoffeeLid, activez « Autoriser les notifications »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Input Monitoring, turn KoffeeLid on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Réglages Système › Confidentialité et sécurité › Surveillance de l’entrée, activez KoffeeLid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen Recording, turn KoffeeLid on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Réglages Système › Confidentialité et sécurité › Enregistrement de l’écran, activez KoffeeLid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Information": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Informations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l’instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ko-fi opens in your browser. €%d is the smallest tip, and you can type any amount there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ko-fi s’ouvre dans votre navigateur. %d € est le plus petit don, et vous pouvez y saisir le montant que vous voulez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid cannot find this Mac's keyboard, so any keyboard's 🌐 Fn key arms the lid gesture.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ne trouve pas le clavier de ce Mac : la touche 🌐 Fn de n’importe quel clavier arme le geste de l’écran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid is armed but lid sleep is on, so your Mac sleeps when the lid closes. Turn KoffeeLid off, then arm it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid est activé mais la veille à la fermeture est active : votre Mac se met en veille quand l’écran se ferme. Désactivez KoffeeLid, puis activez-le à nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid offers all its features free to everyone, and always will. You can support this project by offering me a coffee.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid offre toutes ses fonctionnalités gratuitement à tout le monde, et ce sera toujours le cas. Vous pouvez soutenir ce projet en m’offrant un café."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last Claude Code event": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dernier événement de Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last one %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dernier le %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last terminal command": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dernière commande du terminal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last turned itself off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dernier arrêt automatique"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Less than a minute": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moins d’une minute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lid sleep": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Veille à la fermeture de l’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac put to sleep": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac mis en veille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac too hot": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac trop chaud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun pour l’instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One-time tip": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don ponctuel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit and reopen KoffeeLid so it can read this Mac's 🌐 Fn key. Until then, any keyboard's 🌐 Fn key arms the lid gesture.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quittez puis rouvrez KoffeeLid pour qu’il lise la touche 🌐 Fn de ce Mac. D’ici là, la touche 🌐 Fn de n’importe quel clavier arme le geste de l’écran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit and reopen KoffeeLid to start it again. Until then, a crash while armed leaves your Mac unable to sleep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quittez puis rouvrez KoffeeLid pour la relancer. D’ici là, un plantage pendant une activation empêche votre Mac de se mettre en veille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Running": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up Claude Code on the Auto-Arm page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurez Claude Code dans la page Activation auto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up the sleep lock on the System page. It asks for your administrator password once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurez le verrou de veille dans la page Système. Votre mot de passe administrateur est demandé une seule fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up the terminal on the Auto-Arm page, then open a new terminal window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurez le terminal dans la page Activation auto, puis ouvrez une nouvelle fenêtre de terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "State": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "État"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêtée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sleep lock did not turn on for this arm, so plugging in the charger or a display change can still sleep your closed Mac. Turn KoffeeLid off, then arm it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le verrou de veille ne s’est pas enclenché pour cette activation : brancher le chargeur ou un changement d’écran peut encore mettre votre Mac fermé en veille. Désactivez KoffeeLid, puis activez-le à nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update is installed. KoffeeLid is running the new version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La mise à jour est installée. KoffeeLid utilise la nouvelle version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac has no lid angle sensor, so the lid gesture and the lid effect are not available. Everything else works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac n’a pas de capteur d’angle de l’écran : le geste et l’effet de l’écran ne sont pas disponibles. Tout le reste fonctionne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This disarms, removes the sleep lock and its sudoers rule (administrator password), unregisters the login items, resets the Screen Recording, Input Monitoring and notification permissions, removes the hooks, and clears every setting. The onboarding then starts again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactive KoffeeLid, retire le verrou de veille et sa règle sudoers (mot de passe administrateur), désinscrit les éléments d’ouverture, réinitialise les autorisations Enregistrement de l’écran, Surveillance de l’entrée et Notifications, retire les hooks, et efface tous les réglages. L’introduction recommence ensuite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip €%d": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Offrir %d €"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ was not installed. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La version %@ n’a pas été installée. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close the MacBook and walk away: Claude Code, builds, servers and downloads keep running on a dark, silent display. Open the lid and your Mac locks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rabattez l’écran et partez : Claude Code, vos builds, serveurs et téléchargements continuent sur un écran noir et silencieux. Rouvrez-le et votre Mac se verrouille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not check: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérification impossible : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Denied": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refusée"
          }
