        }
      }
    },
    "Enabled": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entrée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Échec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flatten again when still for": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remettre à plat après une pause de"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fn": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Général"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Granted": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accordée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold %@ and close the lid to arm for one close": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenir %@ et rabattre l’écran pour activer le temps d’une fermeture"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the key while you start closing the lid. Your Mac stays awake until you open it and log back in. To cancel, reopen the lid a little before it shuts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez la touche en commençant à rabattre l’écran. Votre Mac reste éveillé jusqu’à ce que vous le rouvriez et ouvriez votre session. Pour annuler, rouvrez un peu l’écran avant qu’il soit fermé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If 🌐 Fn opens something when you let go, set “Press 🌐 key to” to “Do Nothing” in Keyboard settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si 🌐 Fn ouvre quelque chose au relâchement, réglez « Appuyer sur 🌐 pour » sur « Ne rien faire » dans les réglages Clavier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ignore commands shorter than": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignorer les commandes plus courtes que"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In System Settings › General › Login Items, turn KoffeeLid on under “Background App Activity”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Réglages Système › Général › Ouverture, activez KoffeeLid sous « Activité des apps en arrière-plan »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input Monitoring": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Surveillance de l’entrée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input Monitoring permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisation de surveillance de l’entrée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install and Relaunch": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer et relancer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a diagnostics log": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tenir un journal de diagnostic"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep this Mac awake with the lid closed and the built-in display off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder ce Mac éveillé lorsque l’écran est rabattu, avec l’écran intégré éteint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Key to hold": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche à maintenir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid cannot replace itself where it is installed. Open the disk image and drag KoffeeLid to Applications, then quit and reopen it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ne peut pas se remplacer là où il est installé. Ouvrez l’image disque et faites glisser KoffeeLid vers Applications, puis quittez et rouvrez-le."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid did not quit. Close its open dialogs, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n’a pas quitté. Fermez ses dialogues ouverts, puis réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "État de KoffeeLid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid adds its hooks to ~/.claude/settings.json and backs the file up first. The wait leaves you time to pick a session up from another device: touching this Mac's keyboard or trackpad ends it at once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ajoute ses hooks à ~/.claude/settings.json, après en avoir fait une copie. L’attente vous laisse le temps de reprendre une session depuis un autre appareil : toucher au clavier ou au trackpad de ce Mac y met fin aussitôt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid adds one line to ~/.zshrc. Open a new terminal window afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ajoute une ligne à ~/.zshrc. Ouvrez ensuite une nouvelle fenêtre de terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid arms itself while work is running and turns itself off once it is over. It never changes the mode you picked yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid s’active tout seul tant que du travail tourne, et se désactive une fois qu’il est fini. Il ne change jamais le mode que vous avez choisi vous-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid cannot start": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ne peut pas démarrer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not change the Mac's sleep setting. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n’a pas pu modifier le réglage de mise en veille du Mac. Réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not lock the screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n'a pas pu verrouiller l'écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not open the power-management connection it needs. Restart the Mac and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n'a pas pu ouvrir la connexion de gestion de l'alimentation dont il a besoin. Redémarrez le Mac et réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not restore lid sleep before quitting. Restart the Mac to reset it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n'a pas pu rétablir la mise en veille à la fermeture de l'écran avant de quitter. Redémarrez le Mac pour la réinitialiser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not run pmset to allow sleep again. Run `sudo pmset disablesleep 0` in Terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n’a pas pu exécuter pmset pour autoriser à nouveau la veille. Exécutez `sudo pmset disablesleep 0` dans le Terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not verify the display setup. Disconnect any additional displays and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n’a pas pu vérifier la configuration des écrans. Déconnectez tous les écrans supplémentaires, puis réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid did not arm": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ne s'est pas activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid did not arm because macOS reports high thermal pressure. Let the Mac cool, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ne s’est pas activé, car macOS signale une pression thermique élevée. Laissez le Mac refroidir, puis réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid did not arm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ne s'est pas activé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid disarmed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid désactivé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid held your Mac awake": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid a maintenu votre Mac éveillé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid in “Background App Activity”": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid dans « Activité des apps en arrière-plan »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid is retrying. Until the warning icon clears, open the lid before leaving your Mac; restarting the Mac always resets this setting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid retente l’opération. Tant que l’icône d’avertissement reste affichée, ouvrez l’écran avant de laisser votre Mac sans surveillance. Le redémarrage du Mac réinitialise toujours ce réglage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid is still starting. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid est encore en train de démarrer. Réessayez dans un instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid needs a few things from macOS. Items marked with a warning are required for a closed Mac to stay awake safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid a besoin de quelques réglages de macOS. Les éléments marqués d’un avertissement sont indispensables pour qu’un Mac fermé reste éveillé en toute sécurité."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir à la connexion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let this Mac sleep normally when the lid closes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisser ce Mac se mettre normalement en veille lorsque l’écran est rabattu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets KoffeeLid come back by itself after a crash and give your Mac its normal sleep back. Turn KoffeeLid on in System Settings › General › Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à KoffeeLid de revenir tout seul après un plantage et de rendre à votre Mac sa veille normale. Activez KoffeeLid dans Réglages Système › Général › Ouverture."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets KoffeeLid read the built-in keyboard's Fn key directly, so only that key arms the lid gesture and an external keyboard's Fn key does not.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à KoffeeLid de lire directement la touche Fn du clavier intégré : seule cette touche arme le geste du capot, pas celle d'un clavier externe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets the lid effect show your desktop folding as the lid closes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à l’effet de fermeture d’afficher votre bureau qui se replie lorsque vous rabattez l’écran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lid Effect": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effet d’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lid angle": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Angle de l'écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lid angle now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Angle actuel de l’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lid angle sensor": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capteur d’angle de l’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lid gesture": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geste de l’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lid sleep could not be restored": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible de rétablir la mise en veille à la fermeture"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lid sleep restoration pending": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rétablissement de la mise en veille en attente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lid-close sound": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son de fermeture"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock it now with Control-Command-Q, then check Settings > General.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrouillez-le maintenant avec Contrôle-Commande-Q, puis vérifiez Réglages > Général."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apparence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for the mug in your menu bar, at the top right. Hold %@ and close the lid anytime to keep working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Repérez la tasse en haut à droite de la barre des menus. À tout moment, maintenez %@ enfoncée et rabattez l’écran pour continuer à travailler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low battery": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Batterie faible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Menu bar and shortcuts": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barre des menus et raccourcis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Missing": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manquant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notification": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notification"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisation des notifications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off ↔ Armed + screen on. From Armed, goes to Armed + screen on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé ↔ Activé + écran allumé. Depuis Activé, passe à Activé + écran allumé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off ↔ Armed. From Armed + screen on, goes to Armed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé ↔ Activé. Depuis Activé + écran allumé, passe à Activé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, KoffeeLid writes nothing to its log. Turn it back on before you report a problem.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans cette option, KoffeeLid n’écrit plus rien dans son journal. Réactivez-la avant de signaler un problème."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On battery, at this level or below, KoffeeLid turns itself off and will not arm, so your Mac can sleep instead of running flat. Plugged in, nothing changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur batterie, à ce niveau ou en dessous, KoffeeLid se désactive et refuse de s’activer : votre Mac peut se mettre en veille au lieu de se vider. Sur secteur, rien ne change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On, KoffeeLid unmutes your Mac and sets this volume just for the sound, then puts your volume back. Off, the sound plays at your current volume, and not at all if your Mac is muted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec cette option, KoffeeLid réactive le son de votre Mac et règle ce volume le temps du son, puis rétablit le vôtre. Sans, le son joue à votre volume actuel, et pas du tout si votre Mac est muet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Diagnostics Log": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir le journal de diagnostic"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Disk Image": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir l’image disque"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Login Items Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir les réglages Ouverture"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the lid first. With the lid closed, the Mac goes to sleep when KoffeeLid quits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez d’abord l’écran. Écran rabattu, le Mac se met en veille dès que KoffeeLid quitte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Option"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. Let KoffeeLid arm itself while Claude Code or a terminal command is running, and disarm a minute after nothing is. Setting up either turns auto-arm on; both can be changed later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Facultatif. Laissez KoffeeLid s’activer tout seul quand Claude Code ou une commande du terminal tourne, et se désactiver une minute après que plus rien ne tourne. Configurer l’un ou l’autre active cette option ; tout se modifie ensuite dans Réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Otherwise, start below": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinon, démarrer sous"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permissions": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perspective": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perspective"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play a sound when the lid closes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jouer un son quand l’écran se ferme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play it at a set volume": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jouer à un volume défini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plays a %d° fold over %d seconds, whether KoffeeLid is armed or not.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Joue un pli de %d° en %d secondes, que KoffeeLid soit activé ou non."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plays when the lid closes while KoffeeLid is armed, so you hear that your Mac stays awake.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Joué quand l’écran se ferme alors que KoffeeLid est activé : vous entendez que votre Mac reste éveillé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preparing the update": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Préparation de la mise à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press %@ to arm with the screen on, or to turn off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyer sur %@ pour activer avec l’écran allumé, ou désactiver"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press %@ to arm, or to turn off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyer sur %@ pour activer, ou désactiver"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aperçu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quitter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit KoffeeLid": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quitter KoffeeLid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ready to install. KoffeeLid will quit and reopen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prête à être installée. KoffeeLid va quitter puis se rouvrir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retirer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove from Claude Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retirer de Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove from the Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retirer du terminal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Report the current KoffeeLid mode: off, armed or armed + screen on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indique le mode actuel de KoffeeLid : désactivé, activé ou activé + écran allumé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Required": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réinitialiser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset KoffeeLid?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réinitialiser KoffeeLid ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset KoffeeLid…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réinitialiser KoffeeLid…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset to Defaults": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rétablir les valeurs par défaut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset turns KoffeeLid off, removes the sleep lock, the login items, the hooks and every permission, and clears every setting. It asks first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réinitialisation désactive KoffeeLid, retire le verrou de veille, les éléments d’ouverture, les hooks et toutes les autorisations, puis efface tous les réglages. Une confirmation est demandée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Responsiveness": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réactivité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Right-click the menu bar icon to arm": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clic droit sur l’icône de la barre des menus pour activer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enregistrement de l’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Recording lets the lid effect show your desktop. Input Monitoring lets the lid gesture tell this Mac's 🌐 Fn key from an external keyboard's. Notifications tell you when KoffeeLid turns itself off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’enregistrement de l’écran permet à l’effet d’écran de montrer votre bureau. La surveillance de l’entrée permet au geste de l’écran de distinguer la touche 🌐 Fn de ce Mac de celle d’un clavier externe. Les notifications vous préviennent quand KoffeeLid se désactive de lui-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Recording permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisation d’enregistrement de l’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écran allumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Server returned status %d.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur a répondu avec le statut %d."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Servers & builds": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serveurs et builds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set Up Claude Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurer Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set Up Sleep Lock…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurer le verrou de veille…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set Up the Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurer le terminal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configuré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up Claude Code or the terminal below. Until then, KoffeeLid cannot tell when work is running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurez Claude Code ou le terminal ci-dessous. D’ici là, KoffeeLid ne peut pas savoir quand du travail tourne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up the sleep lock. It asks for your administrator password once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurez le verrou de veille. Votre mot de passe administrateur est demandé une seule fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
