          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soft edges": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bords adoucis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Software Update": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mise à jour de logiciels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standing by: external display": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente : écran externe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start over": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Repartir de zéro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Startup": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Démarrage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "État"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay armed after Claude Code finishes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rester activé après la fin de Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay armed after a command finishes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rester activé après la fin d’une commande"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Staying awake safely": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rester éveillé en sécurité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops macOS from sleeping the closed Mac when the charger is plugged in or a display changes. Asks for your administrator password once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Empêche macOS de mettre en veille le Mac fermé lorsque le chargeur est branché ou qu’un écran change. Demande votre mot de passe administrateur une seule fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tells KoffeeLid when a Claude Code session is working, so it arms while you close the lid and disarms once the turn is over. Adds hooks to ~/.claude/settings.json (backed up first).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indique à KoffeeLid quand une session Claude Code travaille : il s’active pendant que vous fermez l’écran et se désactive une fois le tour terminé. Ajoute des hooks à ~/.claude/settings.json (sauvegardé d’abord)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tells you when KoffeeLid disarms itself (low battery, thermal pressure) or cannot lock the screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous prévient lorsque KoffeeLid se désactive de lui-même (batterie faible, surchauffe) ou ne parvient pas à verrouiller l’écran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal (zsh)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminal (zsh)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal hook (zsh)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suivi du terminal (zsh)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The account name cannot be written into a sudoers rule.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le nom du compte ne peut pas être écrit dans une règle sudoers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk image could not be opened.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’image disque n’a pas pu être ouverte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk image does not contain KoffeeLid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’image disque ne contient pas KoffeeLid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk image does not hold a newer version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’image disque ne contient pas de version plus récente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download is damaged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le téléchargement est endommagé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first angle is also where your desktop stands upright. Armed from the menu bar or a shortcut, the effect waits for the second angle, so adjusting your screen while you work starts nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le premier angle est aussi celui où votre bureau se tient droit. Activé depuis la barre des menus ou un raccourci, l’effet attend le second angle : ajuster l’écran en travaillant ne déclenche rien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new version could not be put in place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nouvelle version n’a pas pu être mise en place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new version did not start and the previous one could not be put back. Download KoffeeLid again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nouvelle version n’a pas démarré et la précédente n’a pas pu être remise en place. Téléchargez à nouveau KoffeeLid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new version did not start, so the previous one was put back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nouvelle version n’a pas démarré, la précédente a donc été remise en place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The release information could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les informations de version n'ont pas pu être lues."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sleep lock could not be set up": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le verrou de veille n’a pas pu être configuré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sleep lock stops macOS from sleeping your closed Mac when you plug in the charger or a display changes. Background App Activity lets KoffeeLid come back after a crash and give your Mac its normal sleep back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le verrou de veille empêche macOS de mettre en veille votre Mac fermé quand vous branchez le chargeur ou qu’un écran change. « Activité des apps en arrière-plan » permet à KoffeeLid de revenir après un plantage et de rendre à votre Mac sa veille normale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update is not signed by the same developer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La mise à jour n’est pas signée par le même développeur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update’s signature is not valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La signature de la mise à jour n’est pas valide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac has no lid angle sensor, so the lid effect is not available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac n’a pas de capteur d’angle de l’écran : l’effet d’écran n’est pas disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac has no lid angle sensor, so the lid gesture is not available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac n’a pas de capteur d’angle de l’écran : le geste de l’écran n’est pas disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version needs macOS %@ or later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette version nécessite macOS %@ ou une version ultérieure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tick": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tic"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Basculer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle ${applicationName}": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer ou désactiver ${applicationName}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle ${applicationName} screen on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Basculer ${applicationName} écran allumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle KoffeeLid": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer ou désactiver KoffeeLid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle KoffeeLid + screen on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Basculer KoffeeLid + écran allumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle screen on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Basculer écran allumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réessayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn KoffeeLid Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactiver KoffeeLid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off ${applicationName}": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactiver ${applicationName}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off when the battery runs low": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactiver quand la batterie est faible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up to date": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mettre à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Échec de la mise à jour : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mises à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ is available": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La version %@ est disponible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Volume": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volume"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it starts": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déclenchement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While KoffeeLid is armed, your desktop stays upright behind the screen as it folds down. The effect only plays while the lid closes, and nothing is captured while the lid rests.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand KoffeeLid est activé, votre bureau reste droit derrière l’écran qui se rabat. L’effet ne joue que pendant la fermeture, et rien n’est capturé tant que l’écran ne bouge pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you work": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant que vous travaillez"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With the icon hidden, KoffeeLid keeps working. Open it again from the Applications folder or Spotlight to get back to this window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icône masquée, KoffeeLid continue de fonctionner. Rouvrez-le depuis le dossier Applications ou Spotlight pour revenir à cette fenêtre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With the lid gesture, start below": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec le geste de l’écran, démarrer sous"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Work running now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Travail en cours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac locks every time the lid reopens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre Mac se verrouille à chaque réouverture de l’écran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents keep working. Lid closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos agents continuent de travailler. Écran rabattu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "agents": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "agents"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "critical": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "critique"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS reported %@ thermal pressure. Normal lid-close sleep has been restored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS a signalé une pression thermique %@. La mise en veille normale à la fermeture de l’écran a été rétablie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS stopped reporting battery charge while the low-battery safety was enabled. KoffeeLid disarmed so the Mac can sleep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS a cessé de communiquer le niveau de charge alors que la protection contre la batterie faible était activée. KoffeeLid s’est désactivé afin que le Mac puisse se mettre en veille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS tried to sleep the closed Mac after a charger or display change. KoffeeLid kept it running in the background. Set up the sleep lock (see the documentation) to stop this from happening.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS a tenté de mettre en veille le Mac fermé après un changement de chargeur ou d’écran. KoffeeLid l’a maintenu en fonctionnement en arrière-plan. Configurez le verrou de veille (voir la documentation) pour que cela ne se reproduise plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "serious": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "élevée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "~/.claude/settings.json could not be read": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "~/.claude/settings.json n’a pas pu être lu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Disarm once finished” in the menu also ends your own arm, one minute after the work is over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Désactiver une fois terminé », dans le menu, met aussi fin à votre propre activation, une minute après la fin du travail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désinstaller"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall KoffeeLid": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désinstaller KoffeeLid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall KoffeeLid?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désinstaller KoffeeLid ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes everything KoffeeLid set up outside its own folder: what starts it at login, what lets it hold the Mac awake, what it added to Claude Code and to the shell, and its settings and logs. KoffeeLid then moves itself to the Trash and quits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retire tout ce que KoffeeLid a installé hors de son propre dossier : ce qui le lance à l’ouverture de session, ce qui lui permet de garder le Mac allumé, ce qu’il a ajouté à Claude Code et au shell, ainsi que ses réglages et ses journaux. KoffeeLid se met ensuite à la corbeille et quitte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not drag KoffeeLid to the Trash. All of that stays behind, goes on running against an app that is gone, and can make the Mac misbehave.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ne mettez pas KoffeeLid à la corbeille vous-même. Tout cela resterait en place, continuerait de s’exécuter pour une app qui n’existe plus, et peut dérégler le Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid stops holding the Mac awake, gives back the permissions it was granted, removes what starts it at login, what it added to Claude Code and to the shell, and its settings and logs. It then moves itself to the Trash and quits. Removing the sleep lock asks for an administrator password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid cesse de garder le Mac allumé, rend les autorisations qui lui ont été accordées, retire ce qui le lance à l’ouverture de session, ce qu’il a ajouté à Claude Code et au shell, ainsi que ses réglages et ses journaux. Il se met ensuite à la corbeille et quitte. Le retrait du verrou de veille demande un mot de passe administrateur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not move itself to the Trash: %@. Drag it there from the Applications folder; that is all that is left of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n’a pas pu se mettre à la corbeille : %@. Faites-le depuis le dossier Applications ; c’est tout ce qu’il en reste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid has been removed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid a été désinstallé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid has been removed, except for this": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid a été désinstallé, sauf ceci"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid is in the Trash, and nothing it set up is left on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid est dans la corbeille, et rien de ce qu’il avait installé ne reste sur le Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Claude Code hooks could not be removed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les hooks Claude Code n’ont pas pu être retirés : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The line in .zshrc could not be removed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La ligne ajoutée à .zshrc n’a pas pu être retirée : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These files need an administrator password and are still there: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces fichiers demandent un mot de passe administrateur et sont toujours là : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These files could not be removed: %@ (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces fichiers n’ont pas pu être retirés : %@ (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac is still held awake. Run `sudo pmset disablesleep 0` in Terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le Mac est toujours empêché de se mettre en veille. Lancez `sudo pmset disablesleep 0` dans Terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac is still set not to sleep when the lid shuts. Restart the Mac: that always puts it back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le Mac est toujours réglé pour ne pas se mettre en veille quand on rabat l’écran. Redémarrez le Mac : cela le remet toujours en place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last step could not be started: %@. The settings and the KoffeeLid folder in Application Support are still there; remove them by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La dernière étape n’a pas pu démarrer : %@. Les réglages et le dossier KoffeeLid dans Application Support sont toujours là ; retirez-les à la main."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
